        "Create a cinematic advertising visual using the exact Auralis Nova headphones from Image 1.\n\nShow the headphones floating against a dark atmospheric environment while elegant concentric waves of light and subtle particle fields radiate outward from the earcups, visually representing immersive spatial sound.\n\nThe sound visualization must remain sophisticated and physically believable, not a chaotic explosion of effects.\n\nPremium dark environment, subtle blue-white atmospheric light, realistic reflections on the headphones, strong edge lighting and deep cinematic shadows.\n\nThe headphones remain the sharpest and brightest focal point.\n\nLeave clean negative space on the left side for marketing copy.\n\nHigh-end wireless audio advertising, luxury technology campaign, photorealistic commercial photography.\n\nDo not redesign the headphones.\nNo people.\nNo animals.\nNo text.\nNo watermark."
      ],
